{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play as a dog your way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become mankind\u2019s best friend or worst nightmare! Befriend the people around you to get good stuff or just steal anything not locked down. Pick a path with dog skills to hone your dog and perfect the way you want to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/LostPawsLivingGif.gif?t=1742675282\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Survive in a vast modern world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scavenge, loot, and dig your way through life. Explore a world where the people and items are always changing. The city and its surroundings are yours to make your own!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/LostPawsDogcatcherGif.gif?t=1742675282\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Trade for the Best Equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Need a quick snack? How about a weapon or some armor? This cat has it all but drives a hard bargain. Never fear! There is always room to negotiate. Sell special items, haggle, and do favors to get those prices right where you need them to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/LostPawsHaggleGif.gif?t=1742675282\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Deck out your penthouse</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No dog should be without a home. And for you that means getting a badass apartment with the best stuff the city has to offer. Acquire amazing food, water, crafting options, and plenty more by expanding your apartment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/Lost_Paws_Apartment_Gif.gif?t=1742675282\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Uncover the Mystery of Doggo City</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Why are all the other pets missing, what happened to your human, and why do bad things keep happening to you? Work with a colorful cast of allies to uncover the mysteries of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/LostPawsShibuGif.gif?t=1742675282\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Dirt Digger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2027590/3f2283025b06f807ab0c6e1df169920fd1b9e234.jpg"},{"name":"The Heart of Nature","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2027590/07991c3f28f0a7ca2b68b9ca824dc102f9539116.jpg"},{"name":"Unstoppable Force","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2027590/f34a7029b4a8aed807872f86182244e4f9a1dab9.jpg"},{"name":"The Greatest Treasure","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2027590/4001c9ce9558bc5e4fa342fbb4c81c78c0d3dfef.jpg"},{"name":"Dangerous Experience","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2027590/64c69252ecab84cebbb695ebec790ba5af0295f5.jpg"},{"name":"Assert Your Dominance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2027590/dd8a1ae4c655bae1e2ef8a9415ef1dd2d82be7c6.jpg"},{"name":"Urban Terror","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2027590/6c22cb9a6f8629efcb3a5943a473d0cda4ab42e4.jpg"},{"name":"Instructions Unclear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2027590/27456da0d7047bf9ecf62648ffd620d534da416a.jpg"},{"name":"The Floofy Friend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2027590/fe290e05fe5500d891bfe4d2d245221eb4df93e1.jpg"},{"name":"Professional Trader","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2027590/5fea1420