ggle, and do favors to get those prices right where you need them to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/LostPawsHaggleGif.gif?t=1742675282\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Deck out your penthouse</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No dog should be without a home. And for you that means getting a badass apartment with the best stuff the city has to offer. Acquire amazing food, water, crafting options, and plenty more by expanding your apartment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/Lost_Paws_Apartment_Gif.gif?t=1742675282\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Uncover the Mystery of Doggo City</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Why are all the other pets missing, what happened to your human, and why do bad things keep happening to you? Work with a colorful cast of allies to uncover the mysteries of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/LostPawsShibuGif.gif?t=1742675282\" /></p>","developers":["Dungeoneering Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/header.jpg?t=1742675282","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257098866,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257098866/movie480.mp4?t=1739918996","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257098866/movie_max.mp4?t=1739918996"},"name":"Lost Paws 2025 Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/